Indigo keeps that licence. The modifications in this repository are the
interface: an animated four-face Home, a retained poster library, game
details, a rebuilt Settings and System surface, shared controller navigation,
and the cheat presentation around them. The device handlers, patch engine and
loader are upstream's work.

This is an unofficial fork. It is not endorsed by, affiliated with, or
supported by the Swiss project, and issues found here should not be reported
upstream.

